AI Script-to-Video Creator using Gemini

Convert a simple idea or script into a structured video plan with scenes, narration, dialogue, and visual prompts.

Features:

Idea → complete script

Automatic scene breakdown

AI-generated narration

Character dialogue

Shot/camera suggestions

Image-generation prompts

Background music suggestions

Subtitle generation

Export complete video production plan

Tech stack: Python, Gemini API, FastAPI/Streamlit, FFmpeg
